            <title>[IGNITE-18993] ODBC: Regression. Missed handling of single quotes</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-18993</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;When &lt;tt&gt;SQLTables&lt;/tt&gt; is called with param &apos;table type&apos; &lt;tt&gt;&apos;TABLES&apos;&lt;/tt&gt; (with single comma), it returns an empty table list.&lt;br/&gt;
